        54.0,
        321.5814514160156,
        298.80096435546875,
        330.4880065917969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "in the next section. With two independent parameters, the",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        333.5374450683594,
        298.8009948730469,
        342.4440002441406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "parameter adaptation approach can efficiently optimize them,",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        345.492431640625,
        298.8009948730469,
        354.39898681640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "making LP-MBD a solid foundation for ALP-MBD.",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        357.4474182128906,
        268.35528564453125,
        366.3539733886719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "IV. ADAPTIVE LINEAR PATH MODEL-BASED DIFFUSION",
