      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        403.6504211425781,
        298.801025390625,
        412.5569763183594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "during execution. In practice, however, the difficulty of",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        415.60540771484375,
        298.80096435546875,
        424.511962890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "trajectory optimization can vary substantially even within",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        427.5603942871094,
        298.8009338378906,
        436.4669494628906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the same task. For instance, navigation in open space may",
