      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "R the reward function, ρ0 the initial state distribution, and",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        66.52103424072266,
        557.9974975585938,
        77.63892364501953
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "γ the discount factor. At each time step, the agent observes",
      "bbox": [
